# Files that `devops docs generate` writes from the code. `devops docs check` in `devops ci` checks
# them, so the person does not read them in tuicr. Each pattern is in the generated class of
# CONST_DOCS_INVENTORY, and tests/test_tuicr_config.py checks this.
# Lockfiles, the pinned tools lock, CHANGELOG.md and docs/ROADMAP.md stay visible. A change to one
# of them is a change to a trust root or to a rule, and the person must see it.
docs/commands/*.md
docs/CLI_REFERENCE.md
